data: {"item_id":"rs_628558","output_index":0,"sequence_number":226,"summary_index":0,"text":"So current implementation covers Task 001 fully? Let's verify requirements:\n\n- At '/', heading Workboard, textbox labelled Project name, button Create project. Yes.\n- Alert visible with message. ShowAlert uses div id alert with role alert, appears. Should contain message. Good.\n- Blank name handling: showAlert. Works.\n- Display projects rows with data-testid=\"project-row\". Yes.\n- Row includes name and button Open project. Yes.\n- Opening navigates to /projects/\u003cproject-id\u003e. server serves project.html static mapping for that pattern. Yes.\n- Project page shows its name heading and Projects button. In project.html, heading id project-heading, button id back-btn labelled Projects. Works.\n- Persistence via SQLite file workboard.db. DB has projects table. Good.\n- Health endpoint implemented. Yes.\n- Start with npm start. package script provided.\n- Binding to 0.0.0.0 at PORT. Server uses server.listen(PORT, '0.0.0.0'). Good.\n\nThus Task 001 satisfied.\n\nNeed to ensure no extra files untracked. git status?","type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done"}

